      <Text>Judged as a <Text bold>question</Text> (ends with ? or starts with where/what/how/is/can…).</Text>
      <Text>{g.reasons.includes('grounded') ? '✅' : '⬜'} Points at a file, error or screenshot → A (+20), otherwise B (+10)</Text>
